WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Turn a familiar face upside down.
Some details feel less wrong.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Turn the same picture upright.
The distortion becomes easier to see.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The picture did not change.
Your perception of the arrangement did.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Researchers tested faces, objects,
and competing explanations.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That research is not a test
of anyone's meditation audio.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence. Try the free exercise.
Decide what you need.
